{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQ8rrvxhgbNpNGtQQ8Hk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2892,"cache_read_input_tokens":46109,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2892},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ce6c6804-ccfe-43d8-a688-7deb75a7338f","uuid":"38593117-47bc-42f7-97dd-5b53b164f5c0","timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:26:40.194Z","request_id":"req_011CgQ8rrfagyPrDdffWgfVx","thinking_duration_ms":894,"thinking_display":"updates"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQ8rrvxhgbNpNGtQQ8Hk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01GHJVjU1VE8XkZQrqmQvfeC","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-007-ANhoC0/index.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>用 Python 处理 Excel 报表的 5 个技巧</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"多表合并、保留格式写入、透视汇总、条件格式和大文件读取：五个在日常报表里真正省时间的 Python 写法。\">\n  <!-- measure.css 放在第一个：它声明的 measure 层排在最前，页面上的其他样式都会优先于它 -->\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"measure.css\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<article class=\"measure-prose\">\n\n  <header class=\"post-header\">\n    <p class=\"crumb\"><a href=\"#\">技术博客</a> / 数据处理</p>\n    <h1>用 Python 处理 Excel 报表的 5 个技巧</h1>\n    <p class=\"meta\">\n      <span>2026 年 10 月 26 日</span>\n      <span>阅读约 8 分钟</span>\n      <span>pandas 2.2 · openpyxl 3.1</span>\n    </p>\n  </header>\n\n  <p class=\"lead\">每到月底，总有人要把十几个部门交上来的 Excel 拼成一张汇总表，再调格式、标颜色、发邮件。这些重复劳动大部分都可以交给 Python。下面五个技巧来自真实的报表脚本，每个都附了能直接运行的代码。</p>\n\n  <p>示例默认你已经装好了 <code>pandas</code> 和 <code>openpyxl</code>。文中的文件名和列名都是虚构的，换成自己的即可。</p>\n\n  <nav class=\"toc\" aria-label=\"目录\">\n    <p class=\"toc-title\">本文目录</p>\n    <ol>\n      <li><a href=\"#tip-1\">一次读入所有工作表并合并</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#tip-2\">写回已有文件，不破坏原来的格式</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#tip-3\">用 pivot_table 生成汇总报表</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#tip-4\">自动调整列宽并加条件格式</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#tip-5\">读取大文件时省内存</a></li>\n    </ol>\n  </nav>\n\n  <!-- 技巧 1 -->\n  <h2 id=\"tip-1\"><span class=\"num\">01</span>一次读入所有工作表并合并</h2>\n\n  <p>很多报表按月份或部门分成多个工作表，结构完全一样。逐个调用 <code>read_excel</code> 既啰嗦又容易漏表。把 <code>sheet_name</code> 设成 <code>None</code>，pandas 会返回一个字典：键是工作表名，值是对应的 DataFrame。</p>\n\n  <div class=\"code\">\n    <div class=\"code-head\"><span>merge_sheets.py</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code><span class=\"k\">import</span> pandas <span class=\"k\">as</span> pd\n\n<span class=\"c\"># sheet_name=None：读取全部工作表，返回 {表名: DataFrame}</span>\nsheets = pd.<span class=\"f\">read_excel</span>(<span class=\"s\">\"2026年销售明细.xlsx\"</span>, sheet_name=<span class=\"k\">None</span>)\n\n<span class=\"c\"># 合并时把来源表名记成一列，方便后面按月份筛选</span>\ndf = pd.<span class=\"f\">concat</span>(\n    [d.<span class=\"f\">assign</span>(月份=name) <span class=\"k\">for</span> name, d <span class=\"k\">in</span> sheets.<span class=\"f\">items</span>()],\n    ignore_index=<span class=\"k\">True</span>,\n)\n\n<span class=\"f\">print</span>(df.shape)        <span class=\"c\"># (行数, 列数)</span>\n<span class=\"f\">print</span>(df[<span class=\"s\">\"月份\"</span>].<span class=\"f\">unique</span>())</code></pre>\n  </div>\n\n  <p>如果要合并的是一个文件夹里的多个文件，思路相同，只是外面再套一层 <code>glob</code>：</p>\n\n  <div class=\"code\">\n    <div class=\"code-head\"><span>merge_files.py</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code><span class=\"k\">from</span> pathlib <span class=\"k\">import</span> Path\n<span class=\"k\">import</span> pandas <span class=\"k\">as</span> pd\n\nframes = []\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> path <span class=\"k\">in</span> <span class=\"f\">sorted</span>(<span class=\"f\">Path</span>(<span class=\"s\">\"部门报表\"</span>).<span class=\"f\">glob</span>(<span class=\"s\">\"*.xlsx\"</span>)):\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> path.name.<span class=\"f\">startswith</span>(<span class=\"s\">\"~$\"</span>):   <span class=\"c\"># 跳过 Excel 打开时生成的临时文件</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">continue</span>\n    d = pd.<span class=\"f\">read_excel</span>(path)\n    d[<span class=\"s\">\"来源文件\"</span>] = path.stem\n    frames.<span class=\"f\">append</span>(d)\n\ndf = pd.<span class=\"f\">concat</span>(frames, ignore_index=<span class=\"k\">True</span>)</code></pre>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"note\">\n    <p><span class=\"note-label\">提示</span>各部门的列名常常不统一，比如“金额”和“金额（元）”。合并前先用 <code>d.columns = d.columns.str.strip()</code> 去掉首尾空格，再用一个映射字典统一列名，能少踩很多坑。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 技巧 2 -->\n  <h2 id=\"tip-2\"><span class=\"num\">02</span>写回已有文件，不破坏原来的格式</h2>\n\n  <p>直接 <code>df.to_excel(\"报表.xlsx\")</code> 会生成一个全新的文件，原来的表头样式、公司 Logo、其他工作表统统丢失。正确的做法是用追加模式打开 <code>ExcelWriter</code>，只覆盖需要更新的区域。</p>\n\n  <div class=\"code\">\n    <div class=\"code-head\"><span>write_back.py</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code><span class=\"k\">import</span> pandas <span class=\"k\">as</span> pd\n\nsummary = df.<span class=\"f\">groupby</span>(<span class=\"s\">\"区域\"</span>, as_index=<span class=\"k\">False</span>)[<span class=\"s\">\"销售额\"</span>].<span class=\"f\">sum</span>()\n\n<span class=\"k\">with</span> pd.<span class=\"f\">ExcelWriter</span>(\n    <span class=\"s\">\"月度报表模板.xlsx\"</span>,\n    engine=<span class=\"s\">\"openpyxl\"</span>,\n    mode=<span class=\"s\">\"a\"</span>,                     <span class=\"c\"># 追加到已有文件</span>\n    if_sheet_exists=<span class=\"s\">\"overlay\"</span>,     <span class=\"c\"># 只写数据，保留原有样式</span>\n) <span class=\"k\">as</span> writer:\n    summary.<span class=\"f\">to_excel</span>(\n        writer,\n        sheet_name=<span class=\"s\">\"汇总\"</span>,\n        startrow=<span class=\"n\">3</span>,                 <span class=\"c\"># 从第 4 行开始写，留出模板的标题区</span>\n        index=<span class=\"k\">False</span>,\n        header=<span class=\"k\">False</span>,\n    )</code></pre>\n  </div>\n\n  <p><code>if_sheet_exists</code> 有四个取值，含义差别很大：</p>\n\n  <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n    <table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr><th>取值</th><th>行为</th></tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td><code>\"error\"</code></td><td>工作表已存在就报错（默认）</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>\"new\"</code></td><td>新建一个带数字后缀的工作表，比如“汇总1”</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>\"replace\"</code></td><td>删掉原表再新建，格式会丢</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>\"overlay\"</code></td><td>在原表上直接写入单元格，格式保留</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"note\">\n    <p><span class=\"note-label\">注意</span>写入前要关掉 Excel 里打开的同名文件，否则在 Windows 上会遇到 <code>PermissionError</code>。另外，openpyxl 不会保留图表和数据透视表之外的一些高级对象，重要模板记得先备份。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 技巧 3 -->\n  <h2 id=\"tip-3\"><span class=\"num\">03</span>用 pivot_table 生成汇总报表</h2>\n\n  <p>在 Excel 里拖数据透视表很直观，但每个月都要重新拖一遍。<code>pivot_table</code> 能用一行代码得到同样的结果，而且可以加上合计行。</p>\n\n  <div class=\"code\">\n    <div class=\"code-head\"><span>pivot.py</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>report = pd.<span class=\"f\">pivot_table</span>(\n    df,\n    index=<span class=\"s\">\"区域\"</span>,              <span class=\"c\"># 行</span>\n    columns=<span class=\"s\">\"月份\"</span>,            <span class=\"c\"># 列</span>\n    values=<span class=\"s\">\"销售额\"</span>,           <span class=\"c\"># 值</span>\n    aggfunc=<span class=\"s\">\"sum\"</span>,\n    fill_value=<span class=\"n\">0</span>,              <span class=\"c\"># 没有数据的格子填 0，而不是 NaN</span>\n    margins=<span class=\"k\">True</span>,              <span class=\"c\"># 加上合计行和合计列</span>\n    margins_name=<span class=\"s\">\"合计\"</span>,\n)\n\n<span class=\"c\"># 让月份按自然顺序排列，而不是按字符串排序</span>\norder = [<span class=\"s\">f\"</span>{m}<span class=\"s\">月\"</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> m <span class=\"k\">in</span> <span class=\"f\">range</span>(<span class=\"n\">1</span>, <span class=\"n\">13</span>)]\nreport = report.<span class=\"f\">reindex</span>(\n    columns=[c <span class=\"k\">for</span> c <span class=\"k\">in</span> order <span class=\"k\">if</span> c <span class=\"k\">in</span> report.columns] + [<span class=\"s\">\"合计\"</span>]\n)\n\nreport.<span class=\"f\">to_excel</span>(<span class=\"s\">\"区域月度汇总.xlsx\"</span>)</code></pre>\n  </div>\n\n  <p>需要同时统计多个指标时，给 <code>aggfunc</code> 传字典即可，例如 <code>{\"销售额\": \"sum\", \"订单号\": \"nunique\"}</code>，一张表里就能看到金额和订单数。</p>\n\n  <!-- 技巧 4 -->\n  <h2 id=\"tip-4\"><span class=\"num\">04</span>自动调整列宽并加条件格式</h2>\n\n  <p>pandas 导出的表格列宽都是默认值，长一点的文字会被截断，数字也没有千分位。用 openpyxl 再处理一遍，报表看起来就像手工调过的。</p>\n\n  <div class=\"code\">\n    <div class=\"code-head\"><span>beautify.py</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code><span class=\"k\">from</span> openpyxl <span class=\"k\">import</span> load_workbook\n<span class=\"k\">from</span> openpyxl.formatting.rule <span class=\"k\">import</span> CellIsRule, ColorScaleRule\n<span class=\"k\">from</span> openpyxl.styles <span class=\"k\">import</span> Font, PatternFill\n<span class=\"k\">from</span> openpyxl.utils <span class=\"k\">import</span> get_column_letter\n\nwb = <span class=\"f\">load_workbook</span>(<span class=\"s\">\"区域月度汇总.xlsx\"</span>)\nws = wb.active\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span> <span class=\"f\">display_width</span>(value):\n    <span class=\"s\">\"\"\"中文字符按 2 个宽度计算，英文和数字按 1 个。\"\"\"</span>\n    text = <span class=\"f\">str</span>(value) <span class=\"k\">if</span> value <span class=\"k\">is not</span> <span class=\"k\">None</span> <span class=\"k\">else</span> <span class=\"s\">\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"f\">sum</span>(<span class=\"n\">2</span> <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"f\">ord</span>(ch) &gt; <span class=\"n\">127</span> <span class=\"k\">else</span> <span class=\"n\">1</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> ch <span class=\"k\">in</span> text)\n\n<span class=\"c\"># 1. 按每列最长的内容设置列宽</span>\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> col <span class=\"k\">in</span> ws.<span class=\"f\">iter_cols</span>():\n    width = <span class=\"f\">max</span>(<span class=\"f\">display_width</span>(c.value) <span class=\"k\">for</span> c <span class=\"k\">in</span> col)\n    ws.column_dimensions[<span class=\"f\">get_column_letter</span>(col[<span class=\"n\">0</span>].column)].width = width + <span class=\"n\">2</span>\n\n<span class=\"c\"># 2. 表头加粗、冻结首行</span>\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> cell <span class=\"k\">in</span> ws[<span class=\"n\">1</span>]:\n    cell.font = <span class=\"f\">Font</span>(bold=<span class=\"k\">True</span>)\nws.freeze_panes = <span class=\"s\">\"B2\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"c\"># 3. 数字加千分位</span>\ndata_range = <span class=\"s\">f\"B2:</span>{<span class=\"f\">get_column_letter</span>(ws.max_column)}{ws.max_row}<span class=\"s\">\"</span>\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> row <span class=\"k\">in</span> ws[data_range]:\n    <span class=\"k\">for</span> cell <span class=\"k\">in</span> row:\n        cell.number_format = <span class=\"s\">\"#,##0\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"c\"># 4. 条件格式：低于 10 万标红，整体加三色色阶</span>\nws.conditional_formatting.<span class=\"f\">add</span>(\n    data_range,\n    <span class=\"f\">CellIsRule</span>(operator=<span class=\"s\">\"lessThan\"</span>, formula=[<span class=\"s\">\"100000\"</span>],\n               fill=<span class=\"f\">PatternFill</span>(<span class=\"s\">\"solid\"</span>, fgColor=<span class=\"s\">\"F8D7D3\"</span>)),\n)\nws.conditional_formatting.<span class=\"f\">add</span>(\n    data_range,\n    <span class=\"f\">ColorScaleRule</span>(start_type=<span class=\"s\">\"min\"</span>, start_color=<span class=\"s\">\"FFFFFF\"</span>,\n                   end_type=<span class=\"s\">\"max\"</span>, end_color=<span class=\"s\">\"63BE7B\"</span>),\n)\n\nwb.<span class=\"f\">save</span>(<span class=\"s\">\"区域月度汇总.xlsx\"</span>)</code></pre>\n  </div>\n\n  <p>这里用的是 Excel 原生的条件格式，而不是把颜色直接写进单元格。好处是同事在 Excel 里改了数字，颜色会跟着变。</p>\n\n  <!-- 技巧 5 -->\n  <h2 id=\"tip-5\"><span class=\"num\">05</span>读取大文件时省内存</h2>\n\n  <p>几十万行的导出文件，用默认参数读进来可能要占好几 GB 内存，还要等上一两分钟。三个参数能明显改善：只读需要的列，提前指定类型，以及把重复值多的文本列设成 <code>category</code>。</p>\n\n  <div class=\"code\">\n    <div class=\"code-head\"><span>read_large.py</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>df = pd.<span class=\"f\">read_excel</span>(\n    <span class=\"s\">\"全年订单导出.xlsx\"</span>,\n    usecols=[<span class=\"s\">\"订单日期\"</span>, <span class=\"s\">\"区域\"</span>, <span class=\"s\">\"产品线\"</span>, <span class=\"s\">\"销售额\"</span>],   <span class=\"c\"># 只读需要的列</span>\n    dtype={\n        <span class=\"s\">\"区域\"</span>: <span class=\"s\">\"category\"</span>,       <span class=\"c\"># 重复值多的文本列，内存可降到十分之一</span>\n        <span class=\"s\">\"产品线\"</span>: <span class=\"s\">\"category\"</span>,\n        <span class=\"s\">\"销售额\"</span>: <span class=\"s\">\"float32\"</span>,\n    },\n    parse_dates=[<span class=\"s\">\"订单日期\"</span>],\n)\n\n<span class=\"f\">print</span>(df.<span class=\"f\">memory_usage</span>(deep=<span class=\"k\">True</span>).<span class=\"f\">sum</span>() / <span class=\"n\">1024</span>**<span class=\"n\">2</span>, <span class=\"s\">\"MB\"</span>)</code></pre>\n  </div>\n\n  <p>如果文件大到连读进来都困难，可以用 openpyxl 的只读模式逐行处理，边读边累加，内存占用几乎是常数：</p>\n\n  <div class=\"code\">\n    <div class=\"code-head\"><span>stream_rows.py</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code><span class=\"k\">from</span> collections <span class=\"k\">import</span> defaultdict\n<span class=\"k\">from</span> openpyxl <span class=\"k\">import</span> load_workbook\n\nwb = <span class=\"f\">load_workbook</span>(<span class=\"s\">\"全年订单导出.xlsx\"</span>, read_only=<span class=\"k\">True</span>, data_only=<span class=\"k\">True</span>)\nws = wb.active\n\ntotals = <span class=\"f\">defaultdict</span>(<span class=\"f\">float</span>)\nrows = ws.<span class=\"f\">iter_rows</span>(min_row=<span class=\"n\">2</span>, values_only=<span class=\"k\">True</span>)   <span class=\"c\"># 跳过表头</span>\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> date, region, product, amount <span class=\"k\">in</span> rows:\n    totals[region] += amount <span class=\"k\">or</span> <span class=\"n\">0</span>\n\nwb.<span class=\"f\">close</span>()   <span class=\"c\"># 只读模式会占用文件句柄，用完要关闭</span>\n<span class=\"f\">print</span>(<span class=\"f\">dict</span>(totals))</code></pre>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"note\">\n    <p><span class=\"note-label\">提示</span><code>data_only=True</code> 读取的是公式的计算结果，而不是公式本身。但这个结果是 Excel 上次保存时缓存的；如果文件是由程序生成、从没在 Excel 里打开过，读到的会是 <code>None</code>。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <h2 id=\"summary\">小结</h2>\n\n  <p>把这五个技巧串起来，就是一条完整的报表流水线：合并原始数据，透视汇总，写回模板，最后统一美化。整个脚本通常不超过一百行，跑一次只要几秒钟。</p>\n\n  <p>建议先从你每个月<em>最耗时</em>的那一步开始改，跑通之后再逐步把其他环节接进来。等整条流程稳定了，再配合定时任务，月底那一天就能轻松很多。</p>\n\n  <footer class=\"post-footer\">\n    <ul class=\"tags\" aria-label=\"标签\">\n      <li>Python</li>\n      <li>pandas</li>\n      <li>openpyxl</li>\n      <li>Excel</li>\n      <li>自动化</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>文中代码在 Python 3.12、pandas 2.2、openpyxl 3.1 下测试通过。</p>\n  </footer>\n\n</article>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  document.querySelectorAll(\".copy\").forEach(function (btn) {\n    btn.addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n      var code = btn.closest(\".code\").querySelector(\"pre code\").innerText;\n      var done = function (label) {\n        btn.textContent = label;\n        setTimeout(function () { btn.textContent = \"复制\"; }, 1500);\n      };\n      if (navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText) {\n        navigator.clipboard.writeText(code).then(\n          function () { done(\"已复制\"); },\n          function () { done(\"复制失败\"); }\n        );\n      } else {\n        done(\"复制失败\");\n      }\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2892,"cache_read_input_tokens":46109,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2892},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ce6c6804-ccfe-43d8-a688-7deb75a7338f","uuid":"73a828d4-5029-4dd3-904f-19ce5d22bc5f","timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:27:37.495Z","request_id":"req_011CgQ8rrfagyPrDdffWgfVx","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01GHJVjU1VE8XkZQrqmQvfeC":{"file_path":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-007-ANhoC0/index.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>用 Python 处理 Excel 报表的 5 个技巧</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"多表合并、保留格式写入、透视汇总、条件格式和大文件读取：五个在日常报表里真正省时间的 Python 写法。\">\n  <!-- measure.css 放在第一个：它声明的 measure 层排在最前，页面上的其他样式都会优先于它 -->\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"measure.css\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<article class=\"measure-prose\">\n\n  <header class=\"post-header\">\n    <p class=\"crumb\"><a href=\"#\">技术博客</a> / 数据处理</p>\n    <h1>用 Python 处理 Excel 报表的 5 个技巧</h1>\n    <p class=\"meta\">\n      <span>2026 年 10 月 26 日</span>\n      <span>阅读约 8 分钟</span>\n      <span>pandas 2.2 · openpyxl 3.1</span>\n    </p>\n  </header>\n\n  <p class=\"lead\">每到月底，总有人要把十几个部门交上来的 Excel 拼成一张汇总表，再调格式、标颜色、发邮件。这些重复劳动大部分都可以交给 Python。下面五个技巧来自真实的报表脚本，每个都附了能直接运行的代码。</p>\n\n  <p>示例默认你已经装好了 <code>pandas</code> 和 <code>openpyxl</code>。文中的文件名和列名都是虚构的，换成自己的即可。</p>\n\n  <nav class=\"toc\" aria-label=\"目录\">\n    <p class=\"toc-title\">本文目录</p>\n    <ol>\n      <li><a href=\"#tip-1\">一次读入所有工作表并合并</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#tip-2\">写回已有文件，不破坏原来的格式</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#tip-3\">用 pivot_table 生成汇总报表</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#tip-4\">自动调整列宽并加条件格式</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#tip-5\">读取大文件时省内存</a></li>\n    </ol>\n  </nav>\n\n  <!-- 技巧 1 -->\n  <h2 id=\"tip-1\"><span class=\"num\">01</span>一次读入所有工作表并合并</h2>\n\n  <p>很多报表按月份或部门分成多个工作表，结构完全一样。逐个调用 <code>read_excel</code> 既啰嗦又容易漏表。把 <code>sheet_name</code> 设成 <code>None</code>，pandas 会返回一个字典：键是工作表名，值是对应的 DataFrame。</p>\n\n  <div class=\"code\">\n    <div class=\"code-head\"><span>merge_sheets.py</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code><span class=\"k\">import</span> pandas <span class=\"k\">as</span> pd\n\n<span class=\"c\"># sheet_name=None：读取全部工作表，返回 {表名: DataFrame}</span>\nsheets = pd.<span class=\"f\">read_excel</span>(<span class=\"s\">\"2026年销售明细.xlsx\"</span>, sheet_name=<span class=\"k\">None</span>)\n\n<span class=\"c\"># 合并时把来源表名记成一列，方便后面按月份筛选</span>\ndf = pd.<span class=\"f\">concat</span>(\n    [d.<span class=\"f\">assign</span>(月份=name) <span class=\"k\">for</span> name, d <span class=\"k\">in</span> sheets.<span class=\"f\">items</span>()],\n    ignore_index=<span class=\"k\">True</span>,\n)\n\n<span class=\"f\">print</span>(df.shape)        <span class=\"c\"># (行数, 列数)</span>\n<span class=\"f\">print</span>(df[<span class=\"s\">\"月份\"</span>].<span class=\"f\">unique</span>())</code></pre>\n  </div>\n\n  <p>如果要合并的是一个文件夹里的多个文件，思路相同，只是外面再套一层 <code>glob</code>：</p>\n\n  <div class=\"code\">\n    <div class=\"code-head\"><span>merge_files.py</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code><span class=\"k\">from</span> pathlib <span class=\"k\">import</span> Path\n<span class=\"k\">import</span> pandas <span class=\"k\">as</span> pd\n\nframes = []\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> path <span class=\"k\">in</span> <span class=\"f\">sorted</span>(<span class=\"f\">Path</span>(<span class=\"s\">\"部门报表\"</span>).<span class=\"f\">glob</span>(<span class=\"s\">\"*.xlsx\"</span>)):\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> path.name.<span class=\"f\">startswith</span>(<span class=\"s\">\"~$\"</span>):   <span class=\"c\"># 跳过 Excel 打开时生成的临时文件</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">continue</span>\n    d = pd.<span class=\"f\">read_excel</span>(path)\n    d[<span class=\"s\">\"来源文件\"</span>] = path.stem\n    frames.<span class=\"f\">append</span>(d)\n\ndf = pd.<span class=\"f\">concat</span>(frames, ignore_index=<span class=\"k\">True</span>)</code></pre>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"note\">\n    <p><span class=\"note-label\">提示</span>各部门的列名常常不统一，比如“金额”和“金额（元）”。合并前先用 <code>d.columns = d.columns.str.strip()</code> 去掉首尾空格，再用一个映射字典统一列名，能少踩很多坑。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 技巧 2 -->\n  <h2 id=\"tip-2\"><span class=\"num\">02</span>写回已有文件，不破坏原来的格式</h2>\n\n  <p>直接 <code>df.to_excel(\"报表.xlsx\")</code> 会生成一个全新的文件，原来的表头样式、公司 Logo、其他工作表统统丢失。正确的做法是用追加模式打开 <code>ExcelWriter</code>，只覆盖需要更新的区域。</p>\n\n  <div class=\"code\">\n    <div class=\"code-head\"><span>write_back.py</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code><span class=\"k\">import</span> pandas <span class=\"k\">as</span> pd\n\nsummary = df.<span class=\"f\">groupby</span>(<span class=\"s\">\"区域\"</span>, as_index=<span class=\"k\">False</span>)[<span class=\"s\">\"销售额\"</span>].<span class=\"f\">sum</span>()\n\n<span class=\"k\">with</span> pd.<span class=\"f\">ExcelWriter</span>(\n    <span class=\"s\">\"月度报表模板.xlsx\"</span>,\n    engine=<span class=\"s\">\"openpyxl\"</span>,\n    mode=<span class=\"s\">\"a\"</span>,                     <span class=\"c\"># 追加到已有文件</span>\n    if_sheet_exists=<span class=\"s\">\"overlay\"</span>,     <span class=\"c\"># 只写数据，保留原有样式</span>\n) <span class=\"k\">as</span> writer:\n    summary.<span class=\"f\">to_excel</span>(\n        writer,\n        sheet_name=<span class=\"s\">\"汇总\"</span>,\n        startrow=<span class=\"n\">3</span>,                 <span class=\"c\"># 从第 4 行开始写，留出模板的标题区</span>\n        index=<span class=\"k\">False</span>,\n        header=<span class=\"k\">False</span>,\n    )</code></pre>\n  </div>\n\n  <p><code>if_sheet_exists</code> 有四个取值，含义差别很大：</p>\n\n  <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n    <table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr><th>取值</th><th>行为</th></tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td><code>\"error\"</code></td><td>工作表已存在就报错（默认）</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>\"new\"</code></td><td>新建一个带数字后缀的工作表，比如“汇总1”</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>\"replace\"</code></td><td>删掉原表再新建，格式会丢</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>\"overlay\"</code></td><td>在原表上直接写入单元格，格式保留</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"note\">\n    <p><span class=\"note-label\">注意</span>写入前要关掉 Excel 里打开的同名文件，否则在 Windows 上会遇到 <code>PermissionError</code>。另外，openpyxl 不会保留图表和数据透视表之外的一些高级对象，重要模板记得先备份。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 技巧 3 -->\n  <h2 id=\"tip-3\"><span class=\"num\">03</span>用 pivot_table 生成汇总报表</h2>\n\n  <p>在 Excel 里拖数据透视表很直观，但每个月都要重新拖一遍。<code>pivot_table</code> 能用一行代码得到同样的结果，而且可以加上合计行。</p>\n\n  <div class=\"code\">\n    <div class=\"code-head\"><span>pivot.py</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>report = pd.<span class=\"f\">pivot_table</span>(\n    df,\n    index=<span class=\"s\">\"区域\"</span>,              <span class=\"c\"># 行</span>\n    columns=<span class=\"s\">\"月份\"</span>,            <span class=\"c\"># 列</span>\n    values=<span class=\"s\">\"销售额\"</span>,           <span class=\"c\"># 值</span>\n    aggfunc=<span class=\"s\">\"sum\"</span>,\n    fill_value=<span class=\"n\">0</span>,              <span class=\"c\"># 没有数据的格子填 0，而不是 NaN</span>\n    margins=<span class=\"k\">True</span>,              <span class=\"c\"># 加上合计行和合计列</span>\n    margins_name=<span class=\"s\">\"合计\"</span>,\n)\n\n<span class=\"c\"># 让月份按自然顺序排列，而不是按字符串排序</span>\norder = [<span class=\"s\">f\"</span>{m}<span class=\"s\">月\"</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> m <span class=\"k\">in</span> <span class=\"f\">range</span>(<span class=\"n\">1</span>, <span class=\"n\">13</span>)]\nreport = report.<span class=\"f\">reindex</span>(\n    columns=[c <span class=\"k\">for</span> c <span class=\"k\">in</span> order <span class=\"k\">if</span> c <span class=\"k\">in</span> report.columns] + [<span class=\"s\">\"合计\"</span>]\n)\n\nreport.<span class=\"f\">to_excel</span>(<span class=\"s\">\"区域月度汇总.xlsx\"</span>)</code></pre>\n  </div>\n\n  <p>需要同时统计多个指标时，给 <code>aggfunc</code> 传字典即可，例如 <code>{\"销售额\": \"sum\", \"订单号\": \"nunique\"}</code>，一张表里就能看到金额和订单数。</p>\n\n  <!-- 技巧 4 -->\n  <h2 id=\"tip-4\"><span class=\"num\">04</span>自动调整列宽并加条件格式</h2>\n\n  <p>pandas 导出的表格列宽都是默认值，长一点的文字会被截断，数字也没有千分位。用 openpyxl 再处理一遍，报表看起来就像手工调过的。</p>\n\n  <div class=\"code\">\n    <div class=\"code-head\"><span>beautify.py</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code><span class=\"k\">from</span> openpyxl <span class=\"k\">import</span> load_workbook\n<span class=\"k\">from</span> openpyxl.formatting.rule <span class=\"k\">import</span> CellIsRule, ColorScaleRule\n<span class=\"k\">from</span> openpyxl.styles <span class=\"k\">import</span> Font, PatternFill\n<span class=\"k\">from</span> openpyxl.utils <span class=\"k\">import</span> get_column_letter\n\nwb = <span class=\"f\">load_workbook</span>(<span class=\"s\">\"区域月度汇总.xlsx\"</span>)\nws = wb.active\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span> <span class=\"f\">display_width</span>(value):\n    <span class=\"s\">\"\"\"中文字符按 2 个宽度计算，英文和数字按 1 个。\"\"\"</span>\n    text = <span class=\"f\">str</span>(value) <span class=\"k\">if</span> value <span class=\"k\">is not</span> <span class=\"k\">None</span> <span class=\"k\">else</span> <span class=\"s\">\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"f\">sum</span>(<span class=\"n\">2</span> <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"f\">ord</span>(ch) &gt; <span class=\"n\">127</span> <span class=\"k\">else</span> <span class=\"n\">1</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> ch <span class=\"k\">in</span> text)\n\n<span class=\"c\"># 1. 按每列最长的内容设置列宽</span>\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> col <span class=\"k\">in</span> ws.<span class=\"f\">iter_cols</span>():\n    width = <span class=\"f\">max</span>(<span class=\"f\">display_width</span>(c.value) <span class=\"k\">for</span> c <span class=\"k\">in</span> col)\n    ws.column_dimensions[<span class=\"f\">get_column_letter</span>(col[<span class=\"n\">0</span>].column)].width = width + <span class=\"n\">2</span>\n\n<span class=\"c\"># 2. 表头加粗、冻结首行</span>\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> cell <span class=\"k\">in</span> ws[<span class=\"n\">1</span>]:\n    cell.font = <span class=\"f\">Font</span>(bold=<span class=\"k\">True</span>)\nws.freeze_panes = <span class=\"s\">\"B2\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"c\"># 3. 数字加千分位</span>\ndata_range = <span class=\"s\">f\"B2:</span>{<span class=\"f\">get_column_letter</span>(ws.max_column)}{ws.max_row}<span class=\"s\">\"</span>\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> row <span class=\"k\">in</span> ws[data_range]:\n    <span class=\"k\">for</span> cell <span class=\"k\">in</span> row:\n        cell.number_format = <span class=\"s\">\"#,##0\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"c\"># 4. 条件格式：低于 10 万标红，整体加三色色阶</span>\nws.conditional_formatting.<span class=\"f\">add</span>(\n    data_range,\n    <span class=\"f\">CellIsRule</span>(operator=<span class=\"s\">\"lessThan\"</span>, formula=[<span class=\"s\">\"100000\"</span>],\n               fill=<span class=\"f\">PatternFill</span>(<span class=\"s\">\"solid\"</span>, fgColor=<span class=\"s\">\"F8D7D3\"</span>)),\n)\nws.conditional_formatting.<span class=\"f\">add</span>(\n    data_range,\n    <span class=\"f\">ColorScaleRule</span>(start_type=<span class=\"s\">\"min\"</span>, start_color=<span class=\"s\">\"FFFFFF\"</span>,\n                   end_type=<span class=\"s\">\"max\"</span>, end_color=<span class=\"s\">\"63BE7B\"</span>),\n)\n\nwb.<span class=\"f\">save</span>(<span class=\"s\">\"区域月度汇总.xlsx\"</span>)</code></pre>\n  </div>\n\n  <p>这里用的是 Excel 原生的条件格式，而不是把颜色直接写进单元格。好处是同事在 Excel 里改了数字，颜色会跟着变。</p>\n\n  <!-- 技巧 5 -->\n  <h2 id=\"tip-5\"><span class=\"num\">05</span>读取大文件时省内存</h2>\n\n  <p>几十万行的导出文件，用默认参数读进来可能要占好几 GB 内存，还要等上一两分钟。三个参数能明显改善：只读需要的列，提前指定类型，以及把重复值多的文本列设成 <code>category</code>。</p>\n\n  <div class=\"code\">\n    <div class=\"code-head\"><span>read_large.py</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>df = pd.<span class=\"f\">read_excel</span>(\n    <span class=\"s\">\"全年订单导出.xlsx\"</span>,\n    usecols=[<span class=\"s\">\"订单日期\"</span>, <span class=\"s\">\"区域\"</span>, <span class=\"s\">\"产品线\"</span>, <span class=\"s\">\"销售额\"</span>],   <span class=\"c\"># 只读需要的列</span>\n    dtype={\n        <span class=\"s\">\"区域\"</span>: <span class=\"s\">\"category\"</span>,       <span class=\"c\"># 重复值多的文本列，内存可降到十分之一</span>\n        <span class=\"s\">\"产品线\"</span>: <span class=\"s\">\"category\"</span>,\n        <span class=\"s\">\"销售额\"</span>: <span class=\"s\">\"float32\"</span>,\n    },\n    parse_dates=[<span class=\"s\">\"订单日期\"</span>],\n)\n\n<span class=\"f\">print</span>(df.<span class=\"f\">memory_usage</span>(deep=<span class=\"k\">True</span>).<span class=\"f\">sum</span>() / <span class=\"n\">1024</span>**<span class=\"n\">2</span>, <span class=\"s\">\"MB\"</span>)</code></pre>\n  </div>\n\n  <p>如果文件大到连读进来都困难，可以用 openpyxl 的只读模式逐行处理，边读边累加，内存占用几乎是常数：</p>\n\n  <div class=\"code\">\n    <div class=\"code-head\"><span>stream_rows.py</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code><span class=\"k\">from</span> collections <span class=\"k\">import</span> defaultdict\n<span class=\"k\">from</span> openpyxl <span class=\"k\">import</span> load_workbook\n\nwb = <span class=\"f\">load_workbook</span>(<span class=\"s\">\"全年订单导出.xlsx\"</span>, read_only=<span class=\"k\">True</span>, data_only=<span class=\"k\">True</span>)\nws = wb.active\n\ntotals = <span class=\"f\">defaultdict</span>(<span class=\"f\">float</span>)\nrows = ws.<span class=\"f\">iter_rows</span>(min_row=<span class=\"n\">2</span>, values_only=<span class=\"k\">True</span>)   <span class=\"c\"># 跳过表头</span>\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> date, region, product, amount <span class=\"k\">in</span> rows:\n    totals[region] += amount <span class=\"k\">or</span> <span class=\"n\">0</span>\n\nwb.<span class=\"f\">close</span>()   <span class=\"c\"># 只读模式会占用文件句柄，用完要关闭</span>\n<span class=\"f\">print</span>(<span class=\"f\">dict</span>(totals))</code></pre>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"note\">\n    <p><span class=\"note-label\">提示</span><code>data_only=True</code> 读取的是公式的计算结果，而不是公式本身。但这个结果是 Excel 上次保存时缓存的；如果文件是由程序生成、从没在 Excel 里打开过，读到的会是 <code>None</code>。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <h2 id=\"summary\">小结</h2>\n\n  <p>把这五个技巧串起来，就是一条完整的报表流水线：合并原始数据，透视汇总，写回模板，最后统一美化。整个脚本通常不超过一百行，跑一次只要几秒钟。</p>\n\n  <p>建议先从你每个月<em>最耗时</em>的那一步开始改，跑通之后再逐步把其他环节接进来。等整条流程稳定了，再配合定时任务，月底那一天就能轻松很多。</p>\n\n  <footer class=\"post-footer\">\n    <ul class=\"tags\" aria-label=\"标签\">\n      <li>Python</li>\n      <li>pandas</li>\n      <li>openpyxl</li>\n      <li>Excel</li>\n      <li>自动化</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>文中代码在 Python 3.12、pandas 2.2、openpyxl 3.1 下测试通过。</p>\n  </footer>\n\n</article>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  document.querySelectorAll(\".copy\").forEach(function (btn) {\n    btn.addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n      var code = btn.closest(\".code\").querySelector(\"pre code\").innerText;\n      var done = function (label) {\n        btn.textContent = label;\n        setTimeout(function () { btn.textContent = \"复制\"; }, 1500);\n      };\n      if (navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText) {\n        navigator.clipboard.writeText(code).then(\n          function () { done(\"已复制\"); },\n          function () { done(\"复制失败\"); }\n        );\n      } else {\n        done(\"复制失败\");\n      }\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GHJVjU1VE8XkZQrqmQvfeC","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: <tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-007-ANhoC0/index.html (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ce6c6804-ccfe-43d8-a688-7deb75a7338f","uuid":"c21a00de-6dc7-45f2-bf19-1db2410b3a7a","timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:27:37.501Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"create","filePath":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-007-ANhoC0/index.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>用 Python 处理 Excel 报表的 5 个技巧</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"多表合并、保留格式写入、透视汇总、条件格式和大文件读取：五个在日常报表里真正省时间的 Python 写法。\">\n  <!-- measure.css 放在第一个：它声明的 measure 层排在最前，页面上的其他样式都会优先于它 -->\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"measure.css\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<article class=\"measure-prose\">\n\n  <header class=\"post-header\">\n    <p class=\"crumb\"><a href=\"#\">技术博客</a> / 数据处理</p>\n    <h1>用 Python 处理 Excel 报表的 5 个技巧</h1>\n    <p class=\"meta\">\n      <span>2026 年 10 月 26 日</span>\n      <span>阅读约 8 分钟</span>\n      <span>pandas 2.2 · openpyxl 3.1</span>\n    </p>\n  </header>\n\n  <p class=\"lead\">每到月底，总有人要把十几个部门交上来的 Excel 拼成一张汇总表，再调格式、标颜色、发邮件。这些重复劳动大部分都可以交给 Python。下面五个技巧来自真实的报表脚本，每个都附了能直接运行的代码。</p>\n\n  <p>示例默认你已经装好了 <code>pandas</code> 和 <code>openpyxl</code>。文中的文件名和列名都是虚构的，换成自己的即可。</p>\n\n  <nav class=\"toc\" aria-label=\"目录\">\n    <p class=\"toc-title\">本文目录</p>\n    <ol>\n      <li><a href=\"#tip-1\">一次读入所有工作表并合并</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#tip-2\">写回已有文件，不破坏原来的格式</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#tip-3\">用 pivot_table 生成汇总报表</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#tip-4\">自动调整列宽并加条件格式</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#tip-5\">读取大文件时省内存</a></li>\n    </ol>\n  </nav>\n\n  <!-- 技巧 1 -->\n  <h2 id=\"tip-1\"><span class=\"num\">01</span>一次读入所有工作表并合并</h2>\n\n  <p>很多报表按月份或部门分成多个工作表，结构完全一样。逐个调用 <code>read_excel</code> 既啰嗦又容易漏表。把 <code>sheet_name</code> 设成 <code>None</code>，pandas 会返回一个字典：键是工作表名，值是对应的 DataFrame。</p>\n\n  <div class=\"code\">\n    <div class=\"code-head\"><span>merge_sheets.py</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code><span class=\"k\">import</span> pandas <span class=\"k\">as</span> pd\n\n<span class=\"c\"># sheet_name=None：读取全部工作表，返回 {表名: DataFrame}</span>\nsheets = pd.<span class=\"f\">read_excel</span>(<span class=\"s\">\"2026年销售明细.xlsx\"</span>, sheet_name=<span class=\"k\">None</span>)\n\n<span class=\"c\"># 合并时把来源表名记成一列，方便后面按月份筛选</span>\ndf = pd.<span class=\"f\">concat</span>(\n    [d.<span class=\"f\">assign</span>(月份=name) <span class=\"k\">for</span> name, d <span class=\"k\">in</span> sheets.<span class=\"f\">items</span>()],\n    ignore_index=<span class=\"k\">True</span>,\n)\n\n<span class=\"f\">print</span>(df.shape)        <span class=\"c\"># (行数, 列数)</span>\n<span class=\"f\">print</span>(df[<span class=\"s\">\"月份\"</span>].<span class=\"f\">unique</span>())</code></pre>\n  </div>\n\n  <p>如果要合并的是一个文件夹里的多个文件，思路相同，只是外面再套一层 <code>glob</code>：</p>\n\n  <div class=\"code\">\n    <div class=\"code-head\"><span>merge_files.py</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code><span class=\"k\">from</span> pathlib <span class=\"k\">import</span> Path\n<span class=\"k\">import</span> pandas <span class=\"k\">as</span> pd\n\nframes = []\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> path <span class=\"k\">in</span> <span class=\"f\">sorted</span>(<span class=\"f\">Path</span>(<span class=\"s\">\"部门报表\"</span>).<span class=\"f\">glob</span>(<span class=\"s\">\"*.xlsx\"</span>)):\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> path.name.<span class=\"f\">startswith</span>(<span class=\"s\">\"~$\"</span>):   <span class=\"c\"># 跳过 Excel 打开时生成的临时文件</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">continue</span>\n    d = pd.<span class=\"f\">read_excel</span>(path)\n    d[<span class=\"s\">\"来源文件\"</span>] = path.stem\n    frames.<span class=\"f\">append</span>(d)\n\ndf = pd.<span class=\"f\">concat</span>(frames, ignore_index=<span class=\"k\">True</span>)</code></pre>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"note\">\n    <p><span class=\"note-label\">提示</span>各部门的列名常常不统一，比如“金额”和“金额（元）”。合并前先用 <code>d.columns = d.columns.str.strip()</code> 去掉首尾空格，再用一个映射字典统一列名，能少踩很多坑。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 技巧 2 -->\n  <h2 id=\"tip-2\"><span class=\"num\">02</span>写回已有文件，不破坏原来的格式</h2>\n\n  <p>直接 <code>df.to_excel(\"报表.xlsx\")</code> 会生成一个全新的文件，原来的表头样式、公司 Logo、其他工作表统统丢失。正确的做法是用追加模式打开 <code>ExcelWriter</code>，只覆盖需要更新的区域。</p>\n\n  <div class=\"code\">\n    <div class=\"code-head\"><span>write_back.py</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code><span class=\"k\">import</span> pandas <span class=\"k\">as</span> pd\n\nsummary = df.<span class=\"f\">groupby</span>(<span class=\"s\">\"区域\"</span>, as_index=<span class=\"k\">False</span>)[<span class=\"s\">\"销售额\"</span>].<span class=\"f\">sum</span>()\n\n<span class=\"k\">with</span> pd.<span class=\"f\">ExcelWriter</span>(\n    <span class=\"s\">\"月度报表模板.xlsx\"</span>,\n    engine=<span class=\"s\">\"openpyxl\"</span>,\n    mode=<span class=\"s\">\"a\"</span>,                     <span class=\"c\"># 追加到已有文件</span>\n    if_sheet_exists=<span class=\"s\">\"overlay\"</span>,     <span class=\"c\"># 只写数据，保留原有样式</span>\n) <span class=\"k\">as</span> writer:\n    summary.<span class=\"f\">to_excel</span>(\n        writer,\n        sheet_name=<span class=\"s\">\"汇总\"</span>,\n        startrow=<span class=\"n\">3</span>,                 <span class=\"c\"># 从第 4 行开始写，留出模板的标题区</span>\n        index=<span class=\"k\">False</span>,\n        header=<span class=\"k\">False</span>,\n    )</code></pre>\n  </div>\n\n  <p><code>if_sheet_exists</code> 有四个取值，含义差别很大：</p>\n\n  <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n    <table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr><th>取值</th><th>行为</th></tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td><code>\"error\"</code></td><td>工作表已存在就报错（默认）</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>\"new\"</code></td><td>新建一个带数字后缀的工作表，比如“汇总1”</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>\"replace\"</code></td><td>删掉原表再新建，格式会丢</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>\"overlay\"</code></td><td>在原表上直接写入单元格，格式保留</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"note\">\n    <p><span class=\"note-label\">注意</span>写入前要关掉 Excel 里打开的同名文件，否则在 Windows 上会遇到 <code>PermissionError</code>。另外，openpyxl 不会保留图表和数据透视表之外的一些高级对象，重要模板记得先备份。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 技巧 3 -->\n  <h2 id=\"tip-3\"><span class=\"num\">03</span>用 pivot_table 生成汇总报表</h2>\n\n  <p>在 Excel 里拖数据透视表很直观，但每个月都要重新拖一遍。<code>pivot_table</code> 能用一行代码得到同样的结果，而且可以加上合计行。</p>\n\n  <div class=\"code\">\n    <div class=\"code-head\"><span>pivot.py</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>report = pd.<span class=\"f\">pivot_table</span>(\n    df,\n    index=<span class=\"s\">\"区域\"</span>,              <span class=\"c\"># 行</span>\n    columns=<span class=\"s\">\"月份\"</span>,            <span class=\"c\"># 列</span>\n    values=<span class=\"s\">\"销售额\"</span>,           <span class=\"c\"># 值</span>\n    aggfunc=<span class=\"s\">\"sum\"</span>,\n    fill_value=<span class=\"n\">0</span>,              <span class=\"c\"># 没有数据的格子填 0，而不是 NaN</span>\n    margins=<span class=\"k\">True</span>,              <span class=\"c\"># 加上合计行和合计列</span>\n    margins_name=<span class=\"s\">\"合计\"</span>,\n)\n\n<span class=\"c\"># 让月份按自然顺序排列，而不是按字符串排序</span>\norder = [<span class=\"s\">f\"</span>{m}<span class=\"s\">月\"</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> m <span class=\"k\">in</span> <span class=\"f\">range</span>(<span class=\"n\">1</span>, <span class=\"n\">13</span>)]\nreport = report.<span class=\"f\">reindex</span>(\n    columns=[c <span class=\"k\">for</span> c <span class=\"k\">in</span> order <span class=\"k\">if</span> c <span class=\"k\">in</span> report.columns] + [<span class=\"s\">\"合计\"</span>]\n)\n\nreport.<span class=\"f\">to_excel</span>(<span class=\"s\">\"区域月度汇总.xlsx\"</span>)</code></pre>\n  </div>\n\n  <p>需要同时统计多个指标时，给 <code>aggfunc</code> 传字典即可，例如 <code>{\"销售额\": \"sum\", \"订单号\": \"nunique\"}</code>，一张表里就能看到金额和订单数。</p>\n\n  <!-- 技巧 4 -->\n  <h2 id=\"tip-4\"><span class=\"num\">04</span>自动调整列宽并加条件格式</h2>\n\n  <p>pandas 导出的表格列宽都是默认值，长一点的文字会被截断，数字也没有千分位。用 openpyxl 再处理一遍，报表看起来就像手工调过的。</p>\n\n  <div class=\"code\">\n    <div class=\"code-head\"><span>beautify.py</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code><span class=\"k\">from</span> openpyxl <span class=\"k\">import</span> load_workbook\n<span class=\"k\">from</span> openpyxl.formatting.rule <span class=\"k\">import</span> CellIsRule, ColorScaleRule\n<span class=\"k\">from</span> openpyxl.styles <span class=\"k\">import</span> Font, PatternFill\n<span class=\"k\">from</span> openpyxl.utils <span class=\"k\">import</span> get_column_letter\n\nwb = <span class=\"f\">load_workbook</span>(<span class=\"s\">\"区域月度汇总.xlsx\"</span>)\nws = wb.active\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span> <span class=\"f\">display_width</span>(value):\n    <span class=\"s\">\"\"\"中文字符按 2 个宽度计算，英文和数字按 1 个。\"\"\"</span>\n    text = <span class=\"f\">str</span>(value) <span class=\"k\">if</span> value <span class=\"k\">is not</span> <span class=\"k\">None</span> <span class=\"k\">else</span> <span class=\"s\">\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"f\">sum</span>(<span class=\"n\">2</span> <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"f\">ord</span>(ch) &gt; <span class=\"n\">127</span> <span class=\"k\">else</span> <span class=\"n\">1</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> ch <span class=\"k\">in</span> text)\n\n<span class=\"c\"># 1. 按每列最长的内容设置列宽</span>\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> col <span class=\"k\">in</span> ws.<span class=\"f\">iter_cols</span>():\n    width = <span class=\"f\">max</span>(<span class=\"f\">display_width</span>(c.value) <span class=\"k\">for</span> c <span class=\"k\">in</span> col)\n    ws.column_dimensions[<span class=\"f\">get_column_letter</span>(col[<span class=\"n\">0</span>].column)].width = width + <span class=\"n\">2</span>\n\n<span class=\"c\"># 2. 表头加粗、冻结首行</span>\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> cell <span class=\"k\">in</span> ws[<span class=\"n\">1</span>]:\n    cell.font = <span class=\"f\">Font</span>(bold=<span class=\"k\">True</span>)\nws.freeze_panes = <span class=\"s\">\"B2\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"c\"># 3. 数字加千分位</span>\ndata_range = <span class=\"s\">f\"B2:</span>{<span class=\"f\">get_column_letter</span>(ws.max_column)}{ws.max_row}<span class=\"s\">\"</span>\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> row <span class=\"k\">in</span> ws[data_range]:\n    <span class=\"k\">for</span> cell <span class=\"k\">in</span> row:\n        cell.number_format = <span class=\"s\">\"#,##0\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"c\"># 4. 条件格式：低于 10 万标红，整体加三色色阶</span>\nws.conditional_formatting.<span class=\"f\">add</span>(\n    data_range,\n    <span class=\"f\">CellIsRule</span>(operator=<span class=\"s\">\"lessThan\"</span>, formula=[<span class=\"s\">\"100000\"</span>],\n               fill=<span class=\"f\">PatternFill</span>(<span class=\"s\">\"solid\"</span>, fgColor=<span class=\"s\">\"F8D7D3\"</span>)),\n)\nws.conditional_formatting.<span class=\"f\">add</span>(\n    data_range,\n    <span class=\"f\">ColorScaleRule</span>(start_type=<span class=\"s\">\"min\"</span>, start_color=<span class=\"s\">\"FFFFFF\"</span>,\n                   end_type=<span class=\"s\">\"max\"</span>, end_color=<span class=\"s\">\"63BE7B\"</span>),\n)\n\nwb.<span class=\"f\">save</span>(<span class=\"s\">\"区域月度汇总.xlsx\"</span>)</code></pre>\n  </div>\n\n  <p>这里用的是 Excel 原生的条件格式，而不是把颜色直接写进单元格。好处是同事在 Excel 里改了数字，颜色会跟着变。</p>\n\n  <!-- 技巧 5 -->\n  <h2 id=\"tip-5\"><span class=\"num\">05</span>读取大文件时省内存</h2>\n\n  <p>几十万行的导出文件，用默认参数读进来可能要占好几 GB 内存，还要等上一两分钟。三个参数能明显改善：只读需要的列，提前指定类型，以及把重复值多的文本列设成 <code>category</code>。</p>\n\n  <div class=\"code\">\n    <div class=\"code-head\"><span>read_large.py</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>df = pd.<span class=\"f\">read_excel</span>(\n    <span class=\"s\">\"全年订单导出.xlsx\"</span>,\n    usecols=[<span class=\"s\">\"订单日期\"</span>, <span class=\"s\">\"区域\"</span>, <span class=\"s\">\"产品线\"</span>, <span class=\"s\">\"销售额\"</span>],   <span class=\"c\"># 只读需要的列</span>\n    dtype={\n        <span class=\"s\">\"区域\"</span>: <span class=\"s\">\"category\"</span>,       <span class=\"c\"># 重复值多的文本列，内存可降到十分之一</span>\n        <span class=\"s\">\"产品线\"</span>: <span class=\"s\">\"category\"</span>,\n        <span class=\"s\">\"销售额\"</span>: <span class=\"s\">\"float32\"</span>,\n    },\n    parse_dates=[<span class=\"s\">\"订单日期\"</span>],\n)\n\n<span class=\"f\">print</span>(df.<span class=\"f\">memory_usage</span>(deep=<span class=\"k\">True</span>).<span class=\"f\">sum</span>() / <span class=\"n\">1024</span>**<span class=\"n\">2</span>, <span class=\"s\">\"MB\"</span>)</code></pre>\n  </div>\n\n  <p>如果文件大到连读进来都困难，可以用 openpyxl 的只读模式逐行处理，边读边累加，内存占用几乎是常数：</p>\n\n  <div class=\"code\">\n    <div class=\"code-head\"><span>stream_rows.py</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code><span class=\"k\">from</span> collections <span class=\"k\">import</span> defaultdict\n<span class=\"k\">from</span> openpyxl <span class=\"k\">import</span> load_workbook\n\nwb = <span class=\"f\">load_workbook</span>(<span class=\"s\">\"全年订单导出.xlsx\"</span>, read_only=<span class=\"k\">True</span>, data_only=<span class=\"k\">True</span>)\nws = wb.active\n\ntotals = <span class=\"f\">defaultdict</span>(<span class=\"f\">float</span>)\nrows = ws.<span class=\"f\">iter_rows</span>(min_row=<span class=\"n\">2</span>, values_only=<span class=\"k\">True</span>)   <span class=\"c\"># 跳过表头</span>\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> date, region, product, amount <span class=\"k\">in</span> rows:\n    totals[region] += amount <span class=\"k\">or</span> <span class=\"n\">0</span>\n\nwb.<span class=\"f\">close</span>()   <span class=\"c\"># 只读模式会占用文件句柄，用完要关闭</span>\n<span class=\"f\">print</span>(<span class=\"f\">dict</span>(totals))</code></pre>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"note\">\n    <p><span class=\"note-label\">提示</span><code>data_only=True</code> 读取的是公式的计算结果，而不是公式本身。但这个结果是 Excel 上次保存时缓存的；如果文件是由程序生成、从没在 Excel 里打开过，读到的会是 <code>None</code>。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <h2 id=\"summary\">小结</h2>\n\n  <p>把这五个技巧串起来，就是一条完整的报表流水线：合并原始数据，透视汇总，写回模板，最后统一美化。整个脚本通常不超过一百行，跑一次只要几秒钟。</p>\n\n  <p>建议先从你每个月<em>最耗时</em>的那一步开始改，跑通之后再逐步把其他环节接进来。等整条流程稳定了，再配合定时任务，月底那一天就能轻松很多。</p>\n\n  <footer class=\"post-footer\">\n    <ul class=\"tags\" aria-label=\"标签\">\n      <li>Python</li>\n      <li>pandas</li>\n      <li>openpyxl</li>\n      <li>Excel</li>\n      <li>自动化</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>文中代码在 Python 3.12、pandas 2.2、openpyxl 3.1 下测试通过。</p>\n  </footer>\n\n</article>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  document.querySelectorAll(\".copy\").forEach(function (btn) {\n    btn.addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n      var code = btn.closest(\".code\").querySelector(\"pre code\").innerText;\n      var done = function (label) {\n        btn.textContent = label;\n        setTimeout(function () { btn.textContent = \"复制\"; }, 1500);\n      };\n      if (navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText) {\n        navigator.clipboard.writeText(code).then(\n          function () { done(\"已复制\"); },\n          function () { done(\"复制失败\"); }\n        );\n      } else {\n        done(\"复制失败\");\n      }\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01GHJVjU1VE8XkZQrqmQvfeC","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
